{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Skull Hotel, you play as a housekeeper tasked with cleaning 8 hotel rooms. Beware - deadly entities lurk in 50% of these rooms, waiting for your arrival. With 30 potential hiding spots randomly selected in each playthrough, your survival depends on vigilance: scrutinize every corner, listen carefully for unusual sounds, and remain alert at all times. The &quot;guests&quot; of Skull Hotel always leave subtle clues to their presence - spotting these hints is your only chance to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/bathroom.gif?t=1751653938\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/hunter.gif?t=1751653938\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/jump_scare1.gif?t=1751653938\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/tv.gif?t=1751653938\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739730?t=1751653938","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/3d79353d6bff04c30e04b10a29125c5ad2d3fdc0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751653938","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/716db9b918d249b7cd66003dce1fd3faa6077b92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751653938","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/716db9b918d249b7cd66003dce1fd3faa6077b92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751653938","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"descriptio